        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Prevent Wrong Triggers</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Without the filter, the wrong form could start a sales follow-up, such as a customer service form or feedback survey.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Exercise for Consultants</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Choose the form used for strategy enquiries and note its exact name.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">Create a workflow with the Form Submitted trigger, filter by the exact enquiry form, and keep it unpublished until tested. The filter prevents unrelated forms from triggering your sales sequence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Write the first useful email</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Review your enquiry form</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Open Sites → Forms and confirm your enquiry form has name and email fields.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Create a new workflow</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Open Automation → Workflows and create a workflow named M17 | Consultation enquiry | Follow-up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add and filter the trigger</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Add Form Submitted trigger, filter Form is, and select only your intended enquiry form.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Connect the starting point',
      lesson_number = 2,
      sort_order = 2,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Connect the starting point';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Connect the starting point

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 17 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 17 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'connect-starting-point' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson connect-starting-point not found in module 17';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What trigger starts the follow-up workflow?', 
    '["Contact Created","Form Submitted","Email Opened","Appointment Booked"]'::jsonb,
    'Form Submitted',
    'The workflow starts with the Form Submitted trigger, filtered to only the intended enquiry form. This ensures the right form submissions begin the follow-up sequence.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Why should you filter the Form Submitted trigger by a specific form?', 
    '["To make the workflow run faster","So unrelated forms do not trigger the sales sequence","To reduce the number of workflow executions","Because HighLevel requires it"]'::jsonb,
    'So unrelated forms do not trigger the sales sequence',
    'Without filtering by form, any form submission — including customer service forms or feedback surveys — could trigger your sales follow-up sequence. The filter ensures only the intended enquiry form starts the workflow.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'When should you publish the workflow?', 
    '["Immediately after creating it","Only after successful end-to-end testing","After adding the first email action","When the client asks for it"]'::jsonb,
    'Only after successful end-to-end testing',
    'Keep the workflow unpublished until you have tested it thoroughly. Publishing before testing risks sending incorrect or incomplete follow-ups to real prospects.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
